					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							We are once again taking on the Black Reavers in Mistmoore on Saturday.  Please sign up.  The level is flexible, but don't complain if you die if you are below level 40.  We need some manpower for this one and we definitely need an enchanter and rogue with high pick lock skill.  Invite your friends!  If you need drops please post it or send me an email at malinu@eqguild.net.  Loot will go to guild members first then to those who need it.  Only those attending are considered so forget the alts (unless no one needs the loot).  Profits will go to the guild trasury so we can start building it up!<br />
<br />
Meet in Nexus near PoK book.  Try to be there early!
